USER class Scratch:
USER     """A committed copy of the committed job tree, and jobs copied out of it, all outside the job tree.
USER 
USER     Copied with `.git` and bytecode caches left behind, then `git init` + `git add -A` + `git commit`,
USER     so the copy is the source tree's bytes at one commit and the emitter's revision refusal
USER     (custody_history.py:515-518) cannot mask the defect under test.
USER     """
