USER                                     the digest it approved), maker model and method file,
USER                                     evaluators and their model blocks, per-pass time/batch/
USER                                     run/evidence file, controls (case files), harness logs
USER                                     (external), retention, levelClaimed. See
USER                                     docs/custody-emission.md for its shape.     (the Orchestrator's ledger)
USER   inputs/custody-events.jsonl       the same events, stamped live by kit/custody_ledger.py;
USER                                     each time field carries its file:line source under x-plumbline,
